add('/services/local-starter-pack/','Albany Local Starter Pack | Geek Services','An entry-level business technology offer for Albany organizations: contact capture, FAQ support, and follow-up setup from $350.','Local Starter Pack',p('An entry-level offer within Applied Technology Services. Starting at $350, this focused setup helps local businesses capture inquiries and handle the next response more consistently.')+section('What the setup covers','<ul><li>Contact form and lead capture setup</li><li>FAQ support and customer guidance</li><li>A missed-inquiry follow-up workflow</li><li>A setup summary and next-step guidance</li></ul>')+section('Agree on the right scope',p('The final scope, tool costs, and any ongoing support are agreed before work begins. AI assistants and broader integrations depend on your requirements; a full website rebuild is scoped separately.')+'<a class="button" href="/contact/?interest=Local+Starter+Pack">Ask about the Local Starter Pack</a>')+section('A starting point for Albany businesses',p('Use a focused first project to fix a specific intake problem, then evaluate whether more automation or a wider system is useful.')+link('/services/business-technology/','Explore broader business technology services')))
add('/locations/albany/','Albany Website, AI & Digital Systems Support | Geek Services','Founder-led website, AI, automation, and reporting support for businesses and organizations in Albany and the Capital Region.','Practical Website, AI, and Digital Systems Support for Albany Businesses',p('Geek Services operates online with a primary focus on Albany and the Capital Region. We help businesses, founders, and organizations through remote consultations and project delivery. We do not currently have a public office or walk-in location.')+section('Make inquiries easier to act on',p('A service business cannot always answer while working on a job. A clear service page, a short intake form, and an assigned follow-up step can keep new inquiries from getting buried. Start by documenting who receives each request and what happens next.')+link('/services/websites-and-digital-systems/','Improve website and inquiry systems'))+section('Give small teams better operational visibility',p('A local organization may have event registrations, customer records, or reports spread across several tools. We map the workflow before proposing an integration, and define permissions and ownership alongside the technical work.')+link('/services/business-technology/','Connect business workflows')+p(link('/services/analytics-and-reporting/','Explore analytics and reporting')))+section('Connect technical curiosity with practical work',p('Our founder’s University at Albany studies inform an interest in AI/ML and analytical problem solving. Research summaries make the questions and limitations visible; no university partnership or endorsement is implied.')+link('/research/projects/','Read the research project summaries'))+section('Begin with your Albany project',p('Tell us about your organization, your current tools, and the result you need. We can scope a focused Starter Pack or discuss a custom system.')+'<a class="button" href="/contact/?location=Albany">Discuss an Albany project</a>'))
add('/locations/yonkers/','Yonkers Project-Based Technology Support | Geek Services','Remote, project-based website, lead capture, and follow-up support for Yonkers and Westchester businesses from an Albany-based startup.','Project-Based Digital Support for Yonkers and Westchester',p('Geek Services operates online with Albany and the Capital Region as its primary market, and secondary remote support for Yonkers and Westchester. Founder Leonardo Sotomayor is from Yonkers. We do not have a public office or walk-in location in either service area.')+section('A focused remote project',p('For an owner coordinating service calls and inquiries across Westchester, a clear service-area page and a reliable contact handoff can be more useful than a large redesign. We review your existing site remotely and define a specific improvement with a documented handover.')+link('/services/websites-and-digital-systems/','Explore website and lead capture support'))+section('Follow-up that fits your team',p('Identify one owner for each request, set realistic response expectations, and use a simple status workflow. Remote projects can focus on a form, FAQ, or follow-up process rather than ongoing on-site support.')+link('/services/local-starter-pack/','Review the Local Starter Pack'))+section('Share the project before scheduling',p('Include the current website, the part of the inquiry process that fails, and who manages it. Availability, scope, and delivery arrangements are agreed for each project.')+'<a class="button" href="/contact/?location=Yonkers">Discuss a Yonkers project</a>'))
projects=[('context-aware-language-learning','Context-Aware Language Learning Model','How can adaptive learning account for regional and cultural variation in language use?','Generic exercises can miss the context in which people actually use language.','A concept exploration using NLP-oriented thinking and adaptive learning design to consider regional and cultural variation.','Language-model concepts, NLP, and software design; no reproducible implementation or dataset is published here.','Existing founder materials describe a language-learning concept. No measured learning outcomes or deployed product are claimed.','Language context is a useful design dimension; its learning benefit requires evaluation.','Define a consented dataset, establish a baseline, and test a bounded prototype with human review.','https://aclanthology.org/','ACL Anthology — background literature on natural language processing'),('solar-panel-optimization','Solar Panel Configuration Optimization','How do installation angles and geographic conditions affect modeled solar energy output?','A configuration that works in one location may perform differently under another set of environmental conditions.','A mathematical and analytical investigation using modeling, simulation, and comparisons across U.S. locations.','Mathematical modeling, simulation, environmental variables, and comparative analysis. The source models and input data are not published here.','Documented as an analytical study in founder materials. No field validation or numerical performance claim is made.','Comparisons depend on consistent environmental assumptions and explicit model boundaries.','Publish input assumptions and a reproducible model, then compare outputs with an established reference.','https://pvwatts.nrel.gov/','NREL PVWatts — reference resource for photovoltaic production estimates'),('quantum-key-distribution','Quantum Key Distribution and Communication Efficiency','How do classical cryptography and quantum key distribution differ in security assumptions and communication requirements?','Security mechanisms must be considered alongside communication overhead and implementation constraints.','A conceptual comparison of classical cryptographic methods and quantum key distribution, informed by encryption logic and simulation-oriented reasoning.','Cryptography concepts, technical literature, and analytical comparison. No physical quantum communication system is claimed.','A technical exploration described in founder materials, without a published benchmark, peer-reviewed paper, or production deployment.','Security and efficiency comparisons need an explicit threat model and a clear account of the resources required.','Document the threat model and protocol assumptions, then build a reproducible educational comparison.','https://doi.org/10.1103/RevModPhys.74.145','Gisin et al., Quantum cryptography, Reviews of Modern Physics (2002)')]
