add('/research/','Research and Information Lab | Geek Services','Explore founder-led technical research, AI/ML concepts, energy modeling, cybersecurity, and practical information products.','Research and Information Lab',p('The research division of Geek Services connects technical questions with practical tools and explanations. Its work includes research briefs, technical explainers, modeling, and prototype exploration.')+p('This is a founder-led startup initiative. The project summaries below document existing explorations, with their evidence limits made explicit.')+cards([('/research/projects/','Research and Projects','Language learning, solar energy modeling, and secure communication.'),('/research/briefs/','Research Briefs and Methods','Practical notes on evaluation, measurement, and reproducibility.')])+section('How research connects to services',p('A service engagement starts with a concrete need. Research contributes a way to frame the question, compare approaches, and record uncertainty before a tool is implemented.')+link('/services/','Explore Applied Technology Services')))
